Perform MIC test for enterococci falling in intermediate zone for Vancomycin.
2. Vancomycin screen agar (6μg/mL): For the isolates which grow on VSA, perform vancomycin MIC and to rule out E. gallinarum and E. casseliflavus (having intermediate vancomycin resistance due to vanC), perform motility and pigment production tests.
3. *: Ciprofloxacin, Nitrofurantoin tested only for urinary isolates.
