After appropriate period of incubation, place the tubes on magnetic separation device for 2-3mins until the solution clears.
iii. With the sample tubes still on the magnet, discard the supernatant.
Add 200v of 70% ethanol to the pellet in the sample tube.
Incubate for 30sec at room temperature
iv. With the tubes still on the magnet, discard the supernatant and repeat the 70% ethanol wash step again.
v. Dry the beads by incubating the tubes at room temperature for 3-5mins with the tubes still on the magnet.
Remove the tubes from the magnetic separation device.
vi. Place the tubes back on to the magnetic device and wait 1min until the solution clears.
Transfer the clear supernatant to new tubes for further processing.
