1. Fix slide by flaming.
2. Immerse in ethanol for 1 minute.
3. Place in 5% periodic acid for 5 minutes.
4. Wash gently in running tap water for 2 minutes.
5. Place in basic fuchsin for 2 minutes.
6. Wash gently in running tap water for 2 minutes.
7. Place in sodium metabisulphite (0.5%) for 3-5 minutes.
9. Counter stain with dilute aqueous light green (0.2%) if for 2 minutes.
10.Dehydrate in 70%, 80%, 95%, 100% ethanol and xylene: each for 2 minutes.
