Use of special media Some fungi fail to sporulate on routine media and require special media for sporulation.
Aspergillus spp.grow and produce fruiting bodies on malt extract agar (MEA) & Czapek Dox (CZ) agar.
This medium helps in the development of cleistothecia in Blastomyces dermatitidis & Histoplasma capsulatum, in addition to sporulation in Mucorales.
