In all of these the place of walnut is totally different .
In walnut omega-D fatty acid is present in the largest amount than other kinds of kernels .
The quality most important than all of these in walnut is that ldl cholesterol ( responsible for heart disease ) and C - reactive protein reduces by it .
C - reactive protein has recently been said marked for heart disease .
Walnut is not only advantageous for heart diseases but for many other problems also .
Walnut can also be used for psoriasis and treatment of skin diseases .
Walnut can also be used as a laxative .
