Psoriasis can affect people of all age groups .
Women and men get affected by this disease in the same way .
This disease can start in any part of skin and its symptoms are different in in various parts of body .
It appears on normal skin in the form of dry red rashes else patches from which skin keeps falling skin peel .
It appears as excessive dandruff on scalp and as thickening and cracking of skin of palm and sole .
Formation of tiny holes in nails and their thickening or falling is found in this disease .
This disease feels like gout in joints .
Psoriasis disease goes on for a long time and has the capacity of recurring .
Usually it does not affect daily life in patients but it can also be fatal in some people .
In many patients due to its rejection from the point of view of beauty it becomes a cause of psychological disease .
Treatment of psoriasis disease is most challenging for a dermatologist .
In this giving complete information about disease of patient is most important .
Psoriasis can be controlled but complete treatment is not there .
On getting healed psoriasis definitely recurs in at least 80 percent patient .
This disease starts increasing in winters and healing in summers .
Since medicines that are used in psoriasis can also have quite adverse effects one should get its treatment done by an expert dermatologist only .
Unscientific use of medicines names steroids and stopping them suddenly can prove fatal in this disease .
According to number about 1 percent people of 50 to 65 years of age are afflicted with this disease .
Whereas 10 percent people of 65 years and above fall into the grip of this disease .
This disease is seen in the whole world .
Cause : Deficiency of a chemical names dopamine is the main cause of this disease .
This happens because of continual damage of dopamine producing fibers in a part named substantia nigra of nervous system .
This problem that has come into concordance with dopamine and acetylcholine produces abnormal shivering and stiffness in body .
Other than this deficiency of other chemicals like - nor epinephrine , serotonin , somatostatin can be seen also .
These irregularities of chemicals produces many physical and psychological symptoms like depression .
If one takes a lot at the basic causes of illness then very common and overlooked causes only hold the foundation of this disease .
But keeping in mind cause of age , etc this is considered a normal process of old age and not even a special therapy , etc is done .
Opposite to it is premature aging begins in some individual meaning symptoms of this kind like slowness of physical activities , shivering of body parts and stiffness in body parts , etc starts becoming visible in a young age like 45 years or 50 years then it is called Parkinson `s or Kampvata disease .
Normally production of ` free radical ` is considered to be the cause of aging and body gradually getting weak .
In regions of polluted water and polluted air the number of patients afflicted with this disease is found more .
Environment contaminated with a toxic substance named MPTP that is produced from narcotic heroin also produces diseases like Parkinson `s .
Other than this not taking nutritious diet can also be a basic cause of this disease .
Vitamins , minerals and enzymes present in a nutritious meal work like the anti oxidants that make free radicals inactive .
In absence of nutritious diet activity of free radicals remains increased .
Because of all the above reasons brain cells begin to deteriorate prematurely and there is production of Parkinson ` s disease meaning Kampvata .
Tremors often reach the other hand in 5 to 10 years starting from one hand .
Often in a condition of rest also hands - feet remain in a state of tremors whereas while working and on application of pressure these tremors decrease .
A special kind of tremors are seen in a patient in which thumb of hand of patient keeps rubbing against the index finger in a manner as if patient is making pills or chanting beads .
On occurrence of tremors in feet patient stomps his feet on the ground again and again .
Tremors often end while sleeping .
In emotional excitement or fatigue a rapidity is seen in tremors .
Person afflicted with Parkinson `s disease gradually becomes unsuccessful in maintaining his gait and physical balance .
Patient sometimes falls towards the right sometimes towards left and sometimes towards front and sometimes behind .
Often back of patient is bent and arms remain stuck to body and sort of swinging .
Patient starts taking a lot of time for bathing , changing , eating and other routine tasks .
Verbal pronunciation of patient starts deteriorating slowly and in acute state of disease patient becomes unsuccessful even in talking .
Face of patient becomes expressionless meaning one is unable to guess the state of patient by looking .
Sometimes skin of face and forehead of patient starts appearing sort of oily smooth .
Physical weakness and powerlessness .
Signatures are unable to coincide .
Sometimes these symptoms meaning signatures not matching in bank , etc are the very initial symptoms of this disease .
Patient tries to swallow his saliva repeatedly .
Like it is clear from the causes that eating a nutritious diet , living in a clean environment and expelling toxic substances from body by periodic Ayurvedic Panchkarma therapy , etc keeps any person away from this disease .
A helpful attitude towards the patient and a happy environment also stops the disease from increasing rapidly .
Fulfilment of dopamine chemically or naturally only is its Symptomatic therapy .
Often patient has to eat this medicine throughout life .
In ` common cowitch ` seeds dopamine is found naturally hence if started in a natural and light amount in the beginning of the disease then it happens to be most beneficial for patient .
