If your fat waist is pointing towards some serious disease then fear not because now scientists have found out a way to lose these fats by applying a single injection of Carbonb dioxide .
Fat waist is a danger bell for diseases like type 2 diabetes , high blood pressure and heart disease .
CO2 is a natural gas which forms in our body during respiration .
This poisonous gas mixes in our body soon enough .
CO2 gas in a fixed amount reaching the upper layer of skin through a fine needle with the help of Carboxy therapy activates the skin close by by which blood vessels become slightly broad due to which transmission of Oxygen and nutritious substances in that part also increases .
This is the only cure of getting rid of the pressure that is exerted on eyes .
