There are at least four women in it .
Women in cities are taking less fibrous products which is giving rise to the risk of colon cancer in them .
Diarrhoea and constipation for a long time are symptoms of colon cancer .
Blood in stool , deficiency of blood or loss in weight without any definite reason and complaint of indigestion are indicative to colon cancer .
The pain in the abdomen region of the stomach should not be neglected , this might be a symptom of colon cancer .
Experts says that in most cases , patients take these symptoms ordinary and neglect them .
Due to which the cancer extends to the lymph nodes , which is dangerous .
In initial stage , it occurs in the innermost layer of intestine .
If not treated , this extends to the muscle wall of the colon .
After that it reaches the lymph nodes .
Gradually , other organs might also get affected by the cancer .
Doctors can diagnose it through screening .
Colon cancer is diagnosed through colonoscopy and CT PET scan .
The only way of treatment of colon cancer is surgery .
Depending upon the case , chemotherapy might also be required .
According to Dr. Amit Bhargava if the cancer cell reaches the liver then the patient is given the radio frequency ablation treatment .
The treatment of colon cancer is possible only till it is limited to intestines .
Spreading beyond this , the patient can only live for one and a half year , maximum .
This is the fourth stage .
The treatment of colon cancer is possible only upto the third stage .
This might take three to nine months for it to reach the third stage .
