Neck , shoulders and back muscle are stressed due to long hour sitting on the desk .
Not sitting in the right position might lead to cervical spondylitis and other back problems .
The regular exercise of Yoga makes you aware of the body and also attracts our attention towards the backbone .
If the four stretching steps helps in relaxing your muscle and also helps in sitting in the right position throughout the day .
Chest stretch position opens the blocked chest muscle , reduces the roundness on the shoulder and brings the mid back region in the proper shape .
Bend a little forward .
Bring your shoulders towards the ear and then back to original .
If tour hands does not reach the backrest of the chair then hold its sides and bend your chest forward , then rest you shoulder and leave the upper portion the the chest free .
Inhale for 10 - 15 times and release the stress .
While exhaling slowly remove your hands and let it hang freely on the sides .
Sit for a while and see if there is any relief in your back .
You can feel that it can stretch the neck to an extent , moreover it also brings the desired gap in the vertebrae of the cervical area -LRB- a part of the backbone -RRB- .
Do not rest your back against the chair .
By the way you can also do it standing .
Place your head in straight alignment with the backbone so that you an stand straight .
Inhale , and bend your right head towards the right shoulder on exhaling but do not lift your shoulders .
Inhale and exhale for four to five times and feel the stretch on the left cheek .
Stretch your shoulder and backbone .
Slowly bring your head to the normal position and then repeat repeat the same on the other side .
Repeat it two times on bot h the sides .
If you are sitting in the same position for a long time then some movement is necessary .
Sit straight , inhale while you bring your right shoulder towards the ear .
Exhale while slowly moving your shoulder away from the ear .
Repeat this shoulder movement three times on both right and left side .
After this , bring your shoulders towards the ear while inhaling .
Move the shoulders down in a circular motion while exhaling .
If you are working while sitting for a long time , then twisting will be beneficial .
This is exercise for both chest and shoulders .
Sit on your chair and move your body to one side .
make sure that you are sitting straight .
Keep your backbone straight and inhale .
Then , move towards the back of the chair and hold the backrest while exhaling .
Give some rest to the back muscle and then slowly move away from the chair and then bring your chair parallel to the backrest .
Lift your chest and slowly take a deep breath .
Inhale in the same way for 10 - 15 times .
Then come back to the original position and then repeat the same on the other side .
